;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - \"원스톱서비스-학사관리-수강신청-개인별 강의시간표 조회\"에서 확인 가능</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ※ 학부(과)에서 일괄 수강신청 과목은 삭제 불가, 삭제 시 복구가 어려울 수 있음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ※</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">21학점 범위 내에서 </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">추가 수강신청 가능</span></span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ※</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -10pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">신편입생은 교과목종류가 전문교양</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -10pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, MSC, </span><span style=\"text-indent: -10pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">전공중에 이수대상학년이 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -10pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1~3</span><span style=\"text-indent: -10pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">학년이고 교필</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -10pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"text-indent: -10pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">기필</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -10pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"text-indent: -10pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">전필</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -10pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"text-indent: -10pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">전선</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -10pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"text-indent: -10pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">직필</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -10pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"text-indent: -10pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">교심 교과목에 한해서만 수강신</span><span style=\"text-indent: -10pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">청이 가능(23일)</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"7807\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 0,\n\"dv\": 5,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.0\",\n\"an\": \"